# chromium powers the Mosaic tab thumbnail capture (streamlit-shotter,
# #958 — see api/shots.py / common/secubox_core/shotter.py), triggered on
# wake and on manual "recapturer" clicks, never by a timer. Recommends,
# not Depends: without it, captures fail gracefully (an app just keeps
# its emoji placeholder tile) — nothing else in the package needs it.
# Same rationale as secubox-metablogizer's own Recommends: chromium.
Recommends: streamlit, chromium
